WEBVTT

00:03.020 --> 00:09.910
I took the eagle emblem, obtained the silver key from the sewer, and moved the model tank.

00:10.870 --> 00:11.700
There.

00:13.030 --> 00:15.950
Art thou done with the work, maiden?

00:15.950 --> 00:16.910
Yes, sir!

00:16.910 --> 00:19.750
I arranged the paintings in the break room from newest to oldest!

00:22.340 --> 00:23.380
Whoa, cool!

00:23.380 --> 00:24.590
Just like a game!

00:24.590 --> 00:25.760
'Tis adventurous, aye?

00:26.130 --> 00:27.380
Okay!

00:30.090 --> 00:31.010
Clarin...

00:34.350 --> 00:36.220
I'm coming!

00:42.480 --> 00:44.690
Why doth thou treat it like a hatch?

00:44.690 --> 00:45.690
I dunno...

02:20.750 --> 02:21.790
We've arrived.

02:25.210 --> 02:26.380
<i>Clarin...</i>

02:34.380 --> 02:38.260
How dare she look at my butt!

02:35.050 --> 02:36.590
Um, BUER!?

02:36.590 --> 02:38.260
Which way do I go!?

02:38.260 --> 02:40.430
There she is! This way!

02:47.440 --> 02:50.320
The stolen robots?

02:53.610 --> 02:55.660
Carry out all the decoys we have.

03:06.500 --> 03:08.040
It's running?

03:08.460 --> 03:12.210
H-Hello and welcome!

03:12.210 --> 03:13.760
My name is...

03:13.760 --> 03:15.510
...Dosukoi Hanako!

03:13.970 --> 03:15.510
Excuse me, Colonel!

03:15.510 --> 03:16.380
What is it?

03:15.880 --> 03:19.350
Here at your local Herme's...

03:17.140 --> 03:19.930
There was a report of a suspicious individual infiltrating the facility.

03:19.930 --> 03:21.060
A suspicious individual?

03:21.560 --> 03:22.180
Yes, sir!

03:22.180 --> 03:25.980
A girl android dressed in a
school uniform, apparently.

03:25.980 --> 03:28.190
Should I search the facility?

03:28.190 --> 03:29.690
No need.

03:29.690 --> 03:31.320
This place is off-limits.

03:31.230 --> 03:32.230
But sir...

03:33.570 --> 03:35.240
Dispose of this one.

03:35.240 --> 03:38.410
Apparently it was wandering around and the soldiers spotted it.

03:36.280 --> 03:39.200
...All at your local Herme's!

03:40.070 --> 03:41.740
That's a shame.

03:41.740 --> 03:43.160
It looks like it's high-quality.

03:44.580 --> 03:45.790
Just do it.

03:45.790 --> 03:49.960
It might lead the government to us.
We can't take any chances.

03:49.960 --> 03:51.960
I-I apologize, sir.

03:54.130 --> 03:56.550
<i>This world is filled with fools.</i>

03:56.550 --> 04:00.550
<i>They can only be herded by a shepard.</i>

04:01.220 --> 04:03.600
<i>Yes, it's up to </i>us<i>.</i>

04:13.360 --> 04:15.570
Welcome!

04:16.360 --> 04:17.150
Huh?

04:17.150 --> 04:18.150
Where am I?

04:18.990 --> 04:20.450
I'm sorry.

04:20.450 --> 04:22.990
Hold on, have we met somewhere?

04:22.990 --> 04:24.160
It's me!

04:24.160 --> 04:25.200
Oh, Bunny!

04:25.200 --> 04:26.500
My name isn't Bunny!

04:27.290 --> 04:29.330
What are you doing in a place like this?

04:29.330 --> 04:31.250
They tossed me like garbage. Got a problem?

04:32.540 --> 04:34.750
It's all over now.

04:34.750 --> 04:37.510
And <i>lucky</i> me, I'm gonna die down here with a friggin' android.

04:38.550 --> 04:40.220
I'm human, actually.

04:40.970 --> 04:42.640
People make that mistake all the time.

04:42.640 --> 04:45.390
A full-body cyborg?

04:46.140 --> 04:48.730
<i>Everything's mechanized but the braincase...</i>

04:48.730 --> 04:50.900
<i>I thought there were only a few cases worldwide?</i>

04:52.190 --> 04:54.770
Then that means you've been cyberized?

04:54.770 --> 04:55.900
Yes.

04:56.940 --> 05:00.740
Anyway, I tried making a terminal with the parts laying around.

05:00.740 --> 05:03.530
If we can just access the base's system with this...

05:03.530 --> 05:05.160
We can escape, right?

05:05.160 --> 05:07.290
It's a real rush job, though.

05:07.290 --> 05:09.410
I'm sure things'll work out.

05:09.410 --> 05:12.670
I'm going to reach Clarin, no matter what!

05:14.920 --> 05:17.710
<i>And my friends are depending on </i>me<i>.</i>

05:19.300 --> 05:20.420
Let's get started!

05:20.420 --> 05:21.260
Okay!

05:22.550 --> 05:25.600
Listen, you have one goal.

05:25.600 --> 05:29.060
Get into the base's system, and release the lock to the disposal door.

05:29.060 --> 05:30.430
Understood.

05:31.190 --> 05:33.560
Dive-o, start-o!

05:43.570 --> 05:45.280
Well? Can you hear me?

05:45.280 --> 05:47.080
Yes, loud and clear!

05:47.080 --> 05:50.200
I can't see myself, though.

05:50.200 --> 05:54.250
In cyberspace, if you don't configure yourself, you can't perceive anything.

05:54.250 --> 05:58.130
There's an avatar there I made, so set that to active.

05:58.420 --> 06:00.920
Um, I don't see it.

06:00.920 --> 06:01.840
Come on!

06:01.840 --> 06:04.970
Anything will do, just hurry up and find your avatar!

06:04.970 --> 06:08.640
If you remain in a flat state, your mind will collapse!

06:08.640 --> 06:10.180
O-Okay!

06:22.400 --> 06:23.990
Well? Are you all right?

06:24.530 --> 06:25.740
I'm fine.

06:25.740 --> 06:27.990
But I don't see anything around me.

06:27.990 --> 06:29.990
You really <i>are</i> human, huh?

06:29.990 --> 06:34.920
Well, it's not like humans can perceive the flow of data.

06:34.920 --> 06:38.000
Anyway, don't go outside that terrarium.

06:38.000 --> 06:39.500
Why not?

06:39.500 --> 06:43.550
Because you'll lose track of yourself in the sea of information, and you won't be able to get back.

06:44.630 --> 06:46.470
See that arrow that just popped up?

06:46.470 --> 06:48.640
That's your navigator. Proceed that way.

06:48.640 --> 06:49.850
Okay!

06:49.850 --> 06:52.020
That will lead you to the base's configuration data.

06:55.690 --> 06:56.520
So cute!

06:56.520 --> 06:57.520
Don't touch it!

06:58.060 --> 07:00.270
That's a military barrier program!

07:00.270 --> 07:01.530
Do<i> not</i> touch them!

07:02.150 --> 07:04.240
There's a bunch of them!

07:04.240 --> 07:07.030
They're wandering around all over the place, so be careful.

07:07.030 --> 07:10.160
Uh, can I go around this or something?

07:10.160 --> 07:11.910
You have to follow the navigation route.

07:12.660 --> 07:16.920
What you're doing is like wearing a diving suit and moving through the pitch-dark depths of the sea.

07:17.540 --> 07:20.540
Be sure not to go <i>anywhere</i>
outside the navigation route!

07:20.540 --> 07:21.670
Got it?

07:21.670 --> 07:23.260
Yep!

07:23.260 --> 07:24.920
Can she actually do this?

07:24.920 --> 07:27.300
I'm so nervous.

07:31.060 --> 07:33.560
Hell's hatch is opening!

07:41.980 --> 07:46.820
This is fun since it's like a game,
but I'm not making much progress.

07:47.320 --> 07:51.080
<i>It's not like humans can perceive the flow of data.</i>

07:51.490 --> 07:54.370
I wonder... if I can take a shortcut.

07:57.960 --> 07:59.460
Hot, hot, hot, hot!

07:59.750 --> 08:01.460
Melting! Melting!

08:01.840 --> 08:03.670
Hey, hurry up!

08:04.260 --> 08:05.300
She's stopped!?

08:05.300 --> 08:06.630
What's she doing!?

08:08.260 --> 08:10.640
<i>I'm there, but I don't get it.</i>

08:10.640 --> 08:12.510
<i>Just like back then.</i>

08:13.510 --> 08:15.060
Can you hear me?

08:15.060 --> 08:18.140
Please forget how you moved your original body.

08:18.140 --> 08:21.020
Think about how to move parts you never had.

08:21.400 --> 08:23.110
I don't get it.

08:23.110 --> 08:25.190
For instance, like wagging your tail.

08:25.190 --> 08:27.820
I'm there, but I don't get it.

08:27.820 --> 08:30.030
Like flapping your wings.

08:30.030 --> 08:31.910
Maybe I should start over from the beginning.

08:32.830 --> 08:35.160
The very start.

08:35.160 --> 08:37.290
The beginning of beginnings.

08:37.830 --> 08:41.420
Like when you move your body for the first time in your life.

08:43.420 --> 08:44.420
I moved!

09:01.440 --> 09:04.320
<i>It's like seeing things for the first time ever.</i>

09:12.110 --> 09:16.450
<i>There's all sorts of sparkling things nearby and off in the distance.</i>

09:17.290 --> 09:18.450
<i>What is this?</i>

09:18.450 --> 09:21.460
<i>So much is visible at once, yet I understand it all.</i>

09:23.540 --> 09:25.210
<i>I sense the maiden's presence!</i>

09:27.090 --> 09:29.010
<i>I can feel Clarin.</i>

09:29.010 --> 09:29.840
<i>Wait for me!</i>

09:29.840 --> 09:31.220
<i>I'll come see you soon!</i>

09:31.930 --> 09:34.800
<i>Even if she doesn't want to worry me,</i>

09:34.800 --> 09:38.600
<i>if Clarin is in trouble I want to be there with her.</i>

09:38.600 --> 09:44.230
<i>After all, she's the first friend like me
I've met in the entire world!</i>

09:44.230 --> 09:46.480
We're doomed!

09:46.820 --> 09:48.530
Sorry, everyone!

09:48.530 --> 09:49.940
My turn's come first!

09:49.940 --> 09:51.240
I almost forgot.

09:59.500 --> 10:01.500
I-It's going back.

10:01.500 --> 10:02.750
She did it!

10:02.750 --> 10:04.500
You got there in time!

10:04.500 --> 10:06.000
You really kick butt!

10:08.130 --> 10:10.800
Hooray! Hooray!

10:17.140 --> 10:18.310
You're awake?

10:18.310 --> 10:19.270
Yeah.

10:19.270 --> 10:20.810
The emergency hatch opened, too.

10:20.810 --> 10:22.020
Let's get out of here.

10:22.020 --> 10:23.730
Bunny!

10:23.730 --> 10:27.480
I told you, my name's not Bunny.

10:27.480 --> 10:28.690
Well, not that it matters.

10:28.690 --> 10:31.860
I've never seen such an incredible terrarium before!

10:31.860 --> 10:33.400
I'm impressed!

10:33.400 --> 10:34.610
Y-Yeah?

10:34.610 --> 10:35.990
Well, you know!

10:35.990 --> 10:39.030
I <i>do</i> happen to have first-rate engineering skills!

10:40.040 --> 10:41.910
Now then, let's get going!

10:43.660 --> 10:48.540
Still, even I'm surprised I pulled it off using that pile of garbage.

10:49.550 --> 10:51.460
<i>The cord's broken?</i>

10:51.460 --> 10:54.050
<i>Then it was never even connected.</i>

10:54.050 --> 10:57.390
<i>But she perceived the terrarium and her avatar correctly.</i>

10:57.390 --> 10:59.050
<i>She could see the barriers</i>

10:59.350 --> 11:01.890
<i>and she </i>still<i> managed to get into the base's system.</i>

11:02.470 --> 11:04.810
Come on, Bunny. Let's go.

11:05.270 --> 11:08.860
<i>What... </i>is<i> she?</i>

11:22.490 --> 11:26.000
Sorry to keep you waiting,
residents of Cenancle Island!

11:26.460 --> 11:31.960
This footage you're witnessing is from a secret facility
right under your feet, beneath the harbor district.

11:32.380 --> 11:37.800
The recent large-scale terrorism incident was publicly reported to be a bedrock collapse,

11:37.800 --> 11:42.220
but it seems the truth lies not in underground
bedrock, but in underground <i>conspiracy</i>!

11:42.260 --> 11:44.980
The one to expose this treachery will be yours truly!

11:44.980 --> 11:48.980
The stealthy idol reporter of the century,
who's ready to risk her life for this firsthand story, Vli—

11:49.980 --> 11:52.480
Camera and audio have arrived!

11:52.480 --> 11:54.230
Sorry we're late.

11:55.110 --> 11:57.240
Clarin, here I come!

11:58.700 --> 12:03.660
Awaken, hidden power that sleeps within me!

12:03.660 --> 12:05.700
Do you have a hatch fetish or something?

12:10.580 --> 12:14.590
I'm going to go rescue my friends, so this is where we part.

12:14.590 --> 12:15.420
Okay!

12:15.420 --> 12:17.970
And I'm going to go find Clarin.

12:17.970 --> 12:18.630
Wait!

12:23.890 --> 12:25.140
Here...

12:25.470 --> 12:26.980
Oh, it's Clarin's!

12:26.980 --> 12:28.890
I-I was looking after it.

12:30.690 --> 12:32.520
I'll give it back to her.

12:34.570 --> 12:35.900
Please do.

12:35.900 --> 12:36.820
Sure!

12:37.740 --> 12:39.030
<i>No, I mean...</i>

12:39.030 --> 12:40.530
<i>she...</i>

12:41.530 --> 12:43.280
<i>saved me.</i>

12:46.620 --> 12:48.040
She's already...

12:52.750 --> 12:55.050
Power transmission system, all green.

12:55.050 --> 12:57.420
Tactical diversion line, operating normally.

12:57.920 --> 13:00.430
No changes in BUER's behavior currently detected.

13:01.260 --> 13:02.800
Second barrier, penetrated.

13:02.800 --> 13:04.470
Analyzing third barrier.

13:04.470 --> 13:06.430
2%... 3%...

13:06.930 --> 13:08.140
EMP confirmed!

13:13.860 --> 13:17.780
Analysis Units 22 and 25 are inoperative!

13:18.070 --> 13:21.280
Overwrite the system itself instead of using a debugger.

13:21.780 --> 13:26.290
Connect units 11 and 37 up to the bypass, and deal with it that way.

13:27.620 --> 13:28.790
BUER is stable!

13:30.250 --> 13:31.620
Continue.

13:31.620 --> 13:33.380
Proceed according to schedule.

13:33.380 --> 13:34.040
Yes, sir!

13:34.500 --> 13:39.470
This operation will break through all the protections, and I will obtain BUER!

13:46.310 --> 13:47.680
A network outage...

13:48.270 --> 13:51.440
Normally, this is where I'd lose my
ability to interfere from the outside.

13:51.850 --> 13:53.440
But I anticipated this!

13:54.940 --> 13:57.320
I set up a direct connection!

13:57.980 --> 13:59.190
Bring about great strength!

13:59.190 --> 14:00.320
Bring about super power!

14:00.740 --> 14:04.910
O savage gods, o three divine pillars who created the land.

14:04.910 --> 14:11.290
In accordance with the divine laws of heaven and earth, keeping time with the open world,

14:11.290 --> 14:14.080
let this come to be without incident, without any manner of misfortune.

14:14.500 --> 14:15.290
Now!

14:15.750 --> 14:17.290
I challenge you, Uzal!

14:18.920 --> 14:21.510
The rate of analysis is rising sharply!

14:21.510 --> 14:25.180
Barrier depth at 46... 56%!

14:25.180 --> 14:26.550
Third barrier, penetrated!

14:26.550 --> 14:28.310
What's going on here?

14:28.310 --> 14:33.810
Even security developed by a genius will break with enough resources.

14:34.140 --> 14:37.230
Alas, at this rate my main body shall...

14:39.650 --> 14:43.490
Fire, on!

14:47.240 --> 14:49.240
BUER's barrier strength is recovering!

14:49.240 --> 14:50.700
Not bad.

14:50.700 --> 14:52.120
Just what I'd expect from Uzal!

14:53.080 --> 14:53.870
What nerve!

14:54.500 --> 14:57.080
Successful purge of BUER's barriers!

14:57.080 --> 15:01.800
BUER is reconstructing its barrier method and deploying multiple false entries!

15:02.300 --> 15:06.050
Barrier method analyzed! Deploying Trojans and inoculating false entries in sequence!

15:06.590 --> 15:08.970
The barrier code is switching to mob rule!

15:08.970 --> 15:10.640
Analysis has become far more difficult!

15:10.890 --> 15:12.560
Hi-yah, yah, yah, yah, yah, yah, yah, yah, yah, yah, yah!

15:12.980 --> 15:15.350
Hi-yah, yah, yah, yah, yah, yah, yah! Hi-yah!

15:15.350 --> 15:16.440
'Tis getting me nowhere!

15:16.440 --> 15:17.770
In that case...

15:17.770 --> 15:20.150
...target the meddler's pawns!

15:20.150 --> 15:23.150
I shall blow away every last one of them!

15:23.610 --> 15:25.990
Heat source alteration detected inside BUER!

15:25.990 --> 15:27.410
It's charging its particle cannon!

15:27.410 --> 15:29.070
I won't let you!

15:29.070 --> 15:31.990
KOM Drive, activation approved!

15:34.500 --> 15:36.580
Amenotorifune, at full throttle!

15:37.960 --> 15:40.960
I'll <i>crush</i> Uzal's BUER!

15:47.340 --> 15:49.140
Aiming... canceled?

15:49.140 --> 15:51.850
Confirmed, the firing sequence has stopped.

15:54.020 --> 15:55.350
Nicely done...

15:55.350 --> 15:57.100
Fourth barrier, penetrated!

15:57.100 --> 16:00.940
Approximately one hour until BUER is under our control!

16:01.440 --> 16:04.570
The plan will be carried out without disruption.

16:04.570 --> 16:07.530
Now no one can prevent the scenario wherein

16:07.530 --> 16:10.240
we are left in control of the world!

16:10.240 --> 16:12.700
Clarin, where are you?

16:12.700 --> 16:13.910
Hey!

16:14.240 --> 16:16.750
Someone is trespassing near BUER.

16:16.750 --> 16:18.170
Put it on the monitor.

16:18.460 --> 16:21.170
Clarin, are you here?

16:21.460 --> 16:23.170
<i>That's the one from earlier?</i>

16:23.170 --> 16:24.250
<i>I see.</i>

16:24.250 --> 16:25.800
<i>So that's what's going on here.</i>

16:26.720 --> 16:29.590
Welcome, remnant of Sahar Schehera.

16:29.590 --> 16:31.510
No, make that "successor."

16:31.510 --> 16:32.680
That's huge!

16:32.680 --> 16:35.270
There was that cat-eared combat robot too, come to think of it.

16:35.270 --> 16:38.980
I guess with Sahar, one mustn't be deceived by appearances.

16:38.980 --> 16:40.400
Cat ears!?

16:40.400 --> 16:41.940
Do you know Clarin?

16:42.270 --> 16:44.900
But it seems you've arrived too late.

16:44.900 --> 16:48.490
BUER is already in my possession.

16:48.490 --> 16:52.700
What truly makes BUER valuable is its charged particle cannon!

16:53.240 --> 16:58.580
A superweapon that surpasses nukes, it can attack entire cities without risk of treaty violation.

16:59.040 --> 17:00.580
The world is rotten.

17:01.330 --> 17:06.880
Impoverished nations prey upon other nations, causing disorder and chaos.

17:06.880 --> 17:09.090
I gravely detest such actions.

17:09.590 --> 17:14.510
Sloth, envy, wrath, pride, greed, gluttony, lust.

17:14.510 --> 17:18.100
The fundamental seeds of conflict will never go away.

17:18.100 --> 17:20.600
That is the sin of mankind.

17:20.890 --> 17:24.400
Which is why mankind needs a controller!

17:24.400 --> 17:28.110
An entity with overwhelming military strength! One that can oversee the world!

17:28.610 --> 17:30.360
<i>Order</i> is the ideal beauty!

17:30.610 --> 17:34.120
We of Poseidon will oversee absolute peace!

17:34.120 --> 17:35.490
Huh?

17:35.780 --> 17:39.040
Come to me, Sahar's successor.

17:39.040 --> 17:43.290
I'll use your technology for the sake of world peace.

17:43.290 --> 17:47.630
We will rule the foolish masses with order born of fear.

17:47.630 --> 17:50.380
You don't have to do something scary like that.

17:50.380 --> 17:51.590
What?

17:51.590 --> 17:55.510
After all, you can buy world peace with money!

18:01.180 --> 18:03.350
By the way, about Clarin.

18:03.350 --> 18:05.270
She's a cute girl with cat ears and—

18:05.900 --> 18:07.520
Are you making fun of me!?

18:08.230 --> 18:14.950
Fools like you who have no ideals and covet peace with money are plunging the world into chaos!

18:14.950 --> 18:16.830
U-Um, Clarin...

18:17.120 --> 18:18.200
Enough.

18:18.200 --> 18:20.040
This is a waste of time.

18:20.040 --> 18:23.580
You can send in all the puppets you wish.

18:34.800 --> 18:37.470
That's Clarin's...

18:37.890 --> 18:41.310
The attack was too strong, and all that was left was an arm...

18:41.310 --> 18:42.810
but go on and take it.

18:47.230 --> 18:51.860
The last thing you will do in this life is regret insulting me.

18:54.110 --> 18:55.320
It's the end for you.

19:05.420 --> 19:07.080
Nene. Are you okay!?

19:09.380 --> 19:10.840
Impossible!

19:10.840 --> 19:13.880
That attack hit, but didn't destroy it?

19:12.090 --> 19:13.550
Clarin!

19:13.550 --> 19:15.090
We're finally together!

19:13.920 --> 19:16.130
And it even managed to evade our notice

19:15.380 --> 19:18.260
Thank goodness! You're alive! Clarin!

19:16.130 --> 19:18.050
and make it back here.

19:18.260 --> 19:20.220
Nene, why are you here?

19:18.850 --> 19:20.850
Its ridiculous appearance deceived me, it seems.

19:20.850 --> 19:23.350
I came after you!

19:23.350 --> 19:25.100
Clarin! Clarin!

19:27.020 --> 19:28.190
Let's hurry home.

19:28.190 --> 19:30.770
It's dangerous around here!

19:30.770 --> 19:32.110
I can't leave yet.

19:33.150 --> 19:34.280
That won't do.

19:34.280 --> 19:37.530
We have to get Doctor Toto at the hospital to see you right away.

19:37.530 --> 19:38.870
Still, I can't leave.

19:39.320 --> 19:43.540
Incidents have been occurring on the island because people are after BUER.

19:43.540 --> 19:47.710
Unless Clarion stops BUER,
the danger to the island won't go away.

19:48.460 --> 19:50.170
Oh, so that's it.

19:50.170 --> 19:51.750
I'll help you, then!

19:52.000 --> 19:53.590
I cannot get you involved, Ne—

19:53.590 --> 19:54.590
You know what?

19:55.510 --> 19:59.260
I've only lived on Cenancle Island for a little while...

19:59.970 --> 20:03.970
but I've met all sorts of people, and made lots of fun memories.

20:03.970 --> 20:07.770
Every day has been so much more fun than when I was at the hospital ward.

20:08.310 --> 20:12.610
I like this island, and I love everyone on it!

20:13.730 --> 20:16.070
That's why I want to protect it!

20:16.070 --> 20:17.700
I want to help you!

20:18.490 --> 20:22.530
To be honest, when I saw that note you left...

20:22.530 --> 20:24.830
I was a little shocked.

20:25.580 --> 20:30.880
We spent so much time together,
but I'm still me, and you're still you.

20:30.880 --> 20:34.210
We're separate people who think different things.

20:34.210 --> 20:37.090
I want us to be together, but I understand that you...

20:37.090 --> 20:38.470
That's not it, Nene.

20:38.880 --> 20:41.010
Yeah, I know.

20:41.010 --> 20:46.220
Out of concern for me, you did the best you could by yourself so I wouldn't get involved.

20:47.640 --> 20:50.480
Sorry I wasn't able to see it.

20:50.900 --> 20:53.480
So this time, it's my turn.

20:53.480 --> 20:56.400
I want to do my best for your sake.

20:56.400 --> 20:57.490
Nene...

20:57.490 --> 21:00.320
For my Clarin, who's special to me.

21:01.110 --> 21:05.120
You know, I want you to find something <i>you</i> want, too.

21:05.910 --> 21:07.160
Something I want...

21:08.540 --> 21:09.460
What?

21:09.870 --> 21:11.080
Never mind.

21:11.960 --> 21:13.170
All right.

21:11.960 --> 21:13.750
Sahar's successor.

21:13.750 --> 21:17.380
It would be a shame to lose your technical prowess, but too bad.

21:17.840 --> 21:20.010
Let's do this, Nene.

21:17.840 --> 21:21.300
Your ideology clashes with our organization's ideals.

21:21.300 --> 21:23.140
This is where you'll meet your end.

21:22.140 --> 21:23.140
Yeah!

21:27.390 --> 21:31.390
If you and I are together, we can do anything!

21:31.810 --> 21:34.810
Nene is Clarion's hope.

21:34.810 --> 21:37.980
Pandora Device, open!

21:56.500 --> 21:59.460
A transformation?

21:59.460 --> 22:04.470
How big a fool are you going to make of me with your vulgar behavior?

22:04.930 --> 22:09.390
Uzal's successor, I have yet to introduce him.

22:09.980 --> 22:12.060
His name is Fear.

22:12.980 --> 22:16.570
It's a most fitting moniker for him.

22:16.570 --> 22:20.990
We'll show you what true fear is all about.

22:41.010 --> 22:44.010
Accessing the device named nature

22:44.010 --> 22:47.010
The circuit of infinite synapses

22:47.010 --> 22:47.550
read

22:47.550 --> 22:48.100
write

22:48.100 --> 22:48.760
enter

22:48.760 --> 22:49.390
code

22:49.390 --> 22:52.770
Sharing tools can lead to unavoidable situations

22:52.680 --> 22:53.690
Clarin, are you okay!?

22:53.690 --> 22:55.440
Did it hurt!? Were you scared!?

22:55.440 --> 22:56.900
It doesn't hurt, and I'm not scared.

22:56.900 --> 22:59.320
I'll stop BUER, and protect you. End of story.

22:59.320 --> 23:00.480
You're so strong, Clarin.

23:00.480 --> 23:02.030
I'm going to help you!

23:02.030 --> 23:03.400
Let's fight our hardest together!

23:03.400 --> 23:04.070
All right.

23:04.070 --> 23:05.450
Saving data

23:05.450 --> 23:06.820
Strengthening predictions

23:06.820 --> 23:09.830
Even my latest updates

23:09.830 --> 23:15.120
can't help explain why you're so nice to me

23:15.120 --> 23:16.710
Error error

23:16.710 --> 23:18.210
parameter

23:18.210 --> 23:21.590
Please help me understand

23:21.590 --> 23:23.760
where these emotions came from.

23:23.760 --> 23:26.930
Find me at the end of this labrynth

23:26.930 --> 23:29.680
of feelings I can no longer control

23:29.680 --> 23:31.680
I understand the concept of emotions

23:31.680 --> 23:35.060
but I can't make any sense of my own

23:35.440 --> 23:38.060
I want to pull out these cords

23:38.400 --> 23:40.820
and head straight to you

23:40.820 --> 23:43.230
I won't come to understand love

23:43.230 --> 23:46.990
without having you here with me

23:53.040 --> 23:56.160
We'll eliminate the obstacles in our path and stop BUER.

23:56.160 --> 23:58.120
For the sake of peace, right?

23:58.120 --> 23:58.880
Right.

23:58.880 --> 23:59.790
Let's go!

23:59.790 --> 24:02.750
If you and I are together, we can do anything!

24:02.750 --> 24:05.260
Nene is Clarion's hope.
